## Generated assets

All generated design assets (SVG bundles, archives under products/ and
site/) are the property of the operator. Assets downloaded through the
official storefront carry their own grant (see LICENSE.txt inside each
bundle): personal and commercial *use* of the designs is allowed;
reselling or redistributing the raw digital files as-is is not.

## Provenance

Every asset carries an embedded generation marker and the full git history
of this repository documents the exact automated run that produced it.
Unauthorized redistribution will be identified and acted upon.

Contact: via the storefront support links.
